'), ('34951475-4183-418d-90b6-623f465799b4', '470bacf5-f9fb-44b3-b9f4-f5b86d787e7b', '2025-05-21 12:29:08.008564+00', 'ai', 'Okay, I have read the PDF. It's a resume belonging to Yash Goyal, a Bachelor of Technology student in Computer Science and Applied Mathematics at IIIT-Delhi (graduating 2022-26). Here's a summary of his skills and experience:

